  "citation": "Crystal-Ornelas R; Varadharajan C; Bond-Lamberty B; Boye K; Cholia S; Crow M; Devarakonda R; Ely K S; Goldman A; Heinz S; Hendrix V; Damerow J; Pennington S; Burrus M; Kakalia Z; Robles E; Simmonds M; Rogers A; Velliquette T; Weierbach H; Weisenhorn P; Welch J N; Agarwal D A (2021): Data from: \"A guide to using GitHub for developing and versioning data standards and reporting formats\". Environmental Systems Science Data Infrastructure for a Virtual Ecosystem (ESS-DIVE). Dataset. doi:10.15485/1780565",
